    "Timer": "T\u0159\xEDda Timer (\u010Dasova\u010D) umo\u017E\u0148uje prov\xE1d\u011Bt n\u011Bjakou \u010Dinnost opakovan\u011B se zadan\xFDm intervalem opakov\xE1n\xED.",
